Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,去看那个吃灵魂的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see the child that eats souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,为了创造世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to create the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝只能放弃他唯一的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}God had to give up his only kin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我是原初  也将会是终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the beginning, and I will be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是紧密相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她可是上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the sister of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她选中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She picked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你得明白黑暗的这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand this about the Darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她很无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}...she's relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only reason I came off the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要去那儿找到如何阻止她的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where on earth are we gonna find an answer on how to stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"上帝之手"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Hand of God."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.01,0:01:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,只有路西法能打败阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Lucifer can beat Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的能打败她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛拉  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.19,0:01:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,路西法没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.91,0:02:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛拉把他扯了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara ripped him from my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,知道开车时虫子撞在挡风玻璃上的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know when you're driving and a bug hits your windshield?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是那只虫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那阿玛拉说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what Amara said about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  不管她对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever she did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到我的光在淡去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel my spark, my light fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等光消失殆尽时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  告诉我们怎么治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, t-tell us how to fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大概她能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I suppose she could, maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是不可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你兜里是揣了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that was a gun in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一团大杂烩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was a complete and utter dog's breakfast, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道狗也吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know dogs had breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想问问  有人出去看过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just curious -- has anyone bothered to look outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第23集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-似乎是太阳  -要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looks like the sun is -- - Dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛拉为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Amara do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳是地球万物的生命之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun is the source of all life on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它没了  一切都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without it, everything just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,日渐衰落\N{\fnArial\fs30}just wastes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有点本事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got a few tricks up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没死...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dead y...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我扶着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-我还是坐下吧  -嗯  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should probably sit down. - Yeah. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-好了  -我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经对阿玛拉施出全力一击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hit Amara with everything we got,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她像没事人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she walked it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就喝最后一轮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's last call?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:04:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有什么需要我打  杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've got something for me to punch, shoot, or kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我  我去做  做到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me know and I'll do it. I'll do it till I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们要怎么修复太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how are we supposed to fix the friggin' sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(英国  伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐  给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, milady. Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜  我们说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, we've had this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫"小姐"  叫我图妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not "Milady." It's Toni.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,老大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down for his nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,茶摆在书房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tea's laid out in the study.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,皇家天文台的天文学家或许知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}...astronomers at the Royal Observatory may have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,奈吉尔·平菲尔德博士做了解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Nigel Pinfield explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们观测到太阳能量释放降低了6%\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have registered a 6% drop in the sun's energy output,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  事发很突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yes, it happened quite suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但大家需要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}but people need to understand --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳会经历高活跃期和低活跃期\N{\fnArial\fs30}our sun goes through periods of high activity and low activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这虽然有些异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}While this is somewhat... unusual,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但绝不需要担心...\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's certainly nothing to worry abo--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody sun's cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在的形势\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.43,0:07:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这样使用我们的资源是明智的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you sure this is the wisest use of our resources?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(通缉  迪恩·温彻斯特  萨姆·温彻斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(堂亲  全部死亡)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这点酒不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You know what? ‭This isn't gonna be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better make a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没道理不醉着死  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to die sober, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,查尔斯  我去烧水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, I'll put the kettle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈总说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom always said,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么是喝一杯好茶解决不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing a nice wee cup of tea can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要留下  想B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here, find our Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  小卡  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Cass, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有茶壶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teapot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她在利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,找一个力量强大的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find someone with power...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,套近乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}cozies up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后狠狠抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}digs the claws in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不用说  我现在谁都帮不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm not helping anyone right now, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她对我挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been...nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也只有现在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's kind of all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要叫你老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not calling you Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样更轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easier this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我会尽快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'll be home as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给你带上了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Packed you a little something,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,以防你的巫术不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}just if all your mumbo jumbo doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,费格斯很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Fergus was bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一岁之前就会走路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walked before his first birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但他讨厌裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he hated pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,特别讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他会光着身子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd run 'round the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,满村子裸奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}his wee banger just flapping in the breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,亚当和夏娃也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam and Eve were the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-孩子啊  -孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kids. - Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好世界要完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad the world is ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,萨妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samantha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-没干什么  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - ‭Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛拉在外面吞噬太阳呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's out there eating the freaking sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们却什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and we're doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  做点什么都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my better idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为什么都比这样强\N{\fnArial\fs30}because anything is better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我们能把阿玛拉锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we could lock Amara away,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wouldn't do any good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I'm gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,光明与黑暗的宇宙平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cosmic balance between light and dark --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能关住她  就只能杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then if we can't cage her, we have to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样  还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,路西法那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, the whole Lucifer thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好蠢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  不是蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It wasn't stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你让路西法附身你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right to let Lucifer ride shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我和萨姆就不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam wouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对  但那是最佳机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it was our best shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你挑起了重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stepped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮了忙  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, and you do help, Cass. You know, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候  我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes me and Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的事太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}have got so much going on that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,会忘记了其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we forget about everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的生活的确很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you do live exciting lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  也可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's one word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但你一直在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're always there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best friend we've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们的兄弟  小卡  我想要你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our brother, Cass. I want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.99,0:11:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  现在你想杀黑暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so now you want to kill the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cool with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,上次...\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, you know, last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,恰克要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Chuck's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别介意  上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no offense, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  我是要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I -- I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we don't really have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有黑暗  有光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look. Y-You've got darkness and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果失去一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You take one side away a-and --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,会让天平倾斜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It upsets the scales --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,打破全宇宙的平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole balance of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但如果两个都消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. But you take both away,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那么天平两边都空了  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now both sides of the scale are empty, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  就平衡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. It's balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  没错  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yes. Okay. Uh, and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我乐意加入  但我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm game, but how exactly are we gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,路西法拿上帝之手攻击了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Lucifer hit her with a-a hand of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我们都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well, we saw how that turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她的确看似不可摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does seem impossible to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she, Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...i-I --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-恰克  -查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chuck! - Charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗或许有个弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness might -- might have a weakness --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在才说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tells us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来只想抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I-I just wanted to trap her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不想杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to murder her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  但既然我们想杀她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but now that we're trying to end her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要多少光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much light are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一万个太阳变成超新星的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}10,000 suns set to supernova.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, y-you're God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,靠上帝的洪荒之力弄个出来呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, just God them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在状态不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}not in the best shape right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要另想主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we just need other ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,, 《诅咒之书》呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Book of the Damned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这远超...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beyond...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我没主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂呢  灵魂是你恶魔交易的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about souls? They fuel your demon deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就像活电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Souls are living batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,充满能量和光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're full of energy. They're full of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one is as powerful as...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,100个太阳的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 suns?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们得到了这样的能量  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so if we got this kind of juice, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我收集到足够的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get me enough souls...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以做个炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can build a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那样能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that do the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我们需要多少灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. How many souls are we talking here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你们能搞到那样的火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you could get that kind of firepower...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得能成功吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really think it would work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以去问问天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can ask the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂的灵魂多得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven is full of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh, what else we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是有包袱的灵魂  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're just souls with baggage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但我们会需要很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we would need a whole lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,韦弗利山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waverly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,韦弗利山疗养院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waverly Hills Sanatorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那里死过数千人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands died there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有的是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ton of ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是绝望的招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在只有绝望和愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, desperate and stupid's pretty much all we got right now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我去扫荡地狱  看看还剩什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go raid Hell and see what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真觉得这能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really think this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗威娜说能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Rowena said it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是《诅咒之书》的咒语  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Book of the Damned spell, boyos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个小水晶  能吸收鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this wee crystal. It'll suck up all the blimey ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要念句咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the magic word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这里真是名副其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place really lives up to the hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们试试咒语吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give the magic word a shot, because we're six.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们捉鬼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's bust some ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the heck are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼都出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your Casper asses out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你继续干  我去惹惹他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you finish up? I'll go piss them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,念咒语吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the magic word!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语棒棒哒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go magic word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,天使...天堂不肯帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}The angels are -- Heaven won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道末日要来了吧  一切的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know that this is the end, right? Of everything. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的  -他们不在乎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - And they don't care?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不是的  是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not that. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道上帝要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know -- They know God is dying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们觉得我们赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they don't think we can win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样  他们要封锁天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Souls or no souls. They're sealing Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"死得有尊严"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're "Dying with dignity".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  克劳力  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Crowley. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来有我们所需的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I had all the souls we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫"本来"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "had"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我身体不便期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I was indisposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我几个恶魔朋友扫荡了我的藏货\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few of my demonic pals decided to raid my stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在有的不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what we have -- it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that could be nothing but good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice digs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,比莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比莉是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Billie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,盼着我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wants us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可有乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tons of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. H-How did yo--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.45,0:20:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我在韦弗利山看到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you boys at Waverly Hills,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就当我是好奇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and call me a curious kitten,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但末日就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with, you know, credits about to roll,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to ask --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还抓鬼做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you boys busting ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你管呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,死人是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead folks -- kind of my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}spill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在收集灵魂制造一个炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're collecting souls to build a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,把黑暗炸飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}To blow the Darkness to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  什么意思  "好吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Uh, w-what does that mean, "Okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是  照现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means way things are going,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再过一小时我就能来收上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about an hour away from reaping God himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're here to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小建议  你们要灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little tip -- you want souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就该找死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}call a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I like your dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,穿来这公园有点太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty fancy for the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但至少你费心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least you made an effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你想喂喂他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to feed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:22:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我喂这些鸟喂了20年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been feeding these birds going on 20 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就像我的家人一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这听上去疯疯癫癫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that makes me sound like a crazy old bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫几年前死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband died a couple of years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子总给我塞退休社区的宣传单\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my son keeps slipping me these brochures for retirement communities
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就是把老人送去\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.K.A. where they send old folks to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,安安静静等死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not to make a fuss about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你恨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但家庭嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你恨他们  也还是爱他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when you hate them, you still love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好令人激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.63,0:23:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有多少灵魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many souls are in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,几十万\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple hundred...thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我扫荡了冥界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raided the Veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.29,0:23:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我说的  死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, dead folks --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.52,0:23:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.75,0:23:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  会见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,希望不是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hope it's not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有炸弹了  我们只需要找到阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now we have the bomb, so we just got to find Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can track her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她不设防护咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not warded anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.58,0:23:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,何必呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.91,0:24:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个能接近她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need somebody to get close to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone with a...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有个人联系的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.71,0:24:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还等什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.61,0:24:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么把这玩意偷偷带去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I smuggle this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可以塞进你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could always shove it up your --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.45,0:24:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用带着炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't carry the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.17,0:24:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把这里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take what's in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.91,0:24:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,放进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.36,0:24:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等你靠近了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you get close to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样把手指捏在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}you press your fingers together like so --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.52,0:24:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Dean, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.93,0:25:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.35,0:25:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好像我的内脏被火烤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like my insides just got flame-broiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.96,0:25:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的  我们已经远超出正常的界限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, we're so far past normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.10,0:25:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有一小时  或许还多一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got about an hour, maybe a wee bit more,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.89,0:25:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就真的是颗定时炸弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you're literally a walking ticking time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.26,0:26:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.52,0:26:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到美国  我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the States. Where we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯州黎巴嫩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lebanon, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  你不非得这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know, ‭you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然得做\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.92,0:26:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要靠近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.31,0:26:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.97,0:26:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if this works, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,(缅怀玛丽·温彻斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.33,0:26:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bomb goes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:26:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.62,0:27:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cool with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.77,0:27:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管她做了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- Even after everything she's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛拉仍是我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's still my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.42,0:27:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.28,0:27:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能...我不希望她死  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't -- I don't want to see her dead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.90,0:27:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.57,0:27:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:27:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.43,0:28:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我得一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.26,0:28:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  如果...等成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if -- when -- when this works,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  他会非常难过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam -- he's gonna be a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.65,0:28:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,替我照看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So look out for him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他干蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure he doesn't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.64,0:28:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.82,0:28:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.86,0:28:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  听着  我要盛大的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. I want a big funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,史诗般的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I'm talking epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,免费酒吧  唱诗班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Open bar, choir,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色安息日翻唱乐队  加里·布塞给我念悼词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabbath cover band, and Gary Busey reading the eulogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.68,0:28:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.73,0:28:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的骨灰  葬在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for my ashes, I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.90,0:28:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就永远安息地而言  这里不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, as far as eternal resting places go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.23,0:29:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别煽情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chick-flick moments. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.03,0:29:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你就喜欢煽情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Yeah, you love chick flicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right. I do. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.32,0:30:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,(末日将近)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.95,0:30:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.23,0:30:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,(抱歉  关门)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.25,0:30:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就一个小天启  他们就关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One little apocalypse and they shut up shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.83,0:30:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.98,0:30:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你请  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your round, Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.02,0:30:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.70,0:30:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.13,0:30:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.52,0:30:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给你你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to give you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.53,0:30:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.96,0:30:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真是新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能就这么看着世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't just stand by and watch the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友  和家人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends, and my family die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果跟你合体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if becoming a part of you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.52,0:31:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我免遭那样的罪  我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}takes me away from that, then I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.98,0:31:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,和你胸膛里的炸弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that bomb in your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.30,0:31:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得我嗅不出你散发的能量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I can't taste the power coming off of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.62,0:31:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.02,0:31:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是  你一直没法伤到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is you've never been able to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这次又有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what makes this time any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.12,0:31:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你对太阳做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're doing to the sun --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.11,0:31:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.37,0:31:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥越来越虚弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my brother getting weaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.03,0:31:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,天平渐渐倾斜  光明失落\N{\fnArial\fs30}the scales are tipping away from light.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,坠入黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,化为乌有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.68,0:31:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等上帝死了  整个宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}When God's gone, the universe --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所有一切都将不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,包括我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.76,0:31:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然执法部门一直告诉民众无需恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while law enforcement is telling people not to panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.44,0:32:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,并建议居民们留在家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}residents are being advised to stay in their homes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.13,0:32:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但当局也困惑于...\N{\fnArial\fs30}as authorities are baffled by this st--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.48,0:32:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.02,0:32:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他将我囚禁了数十亿年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He locked me away for billions of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.87,0:32:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他还派你来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent you to execute me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.44,0:32:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.59,0:32:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他的确把我送到了这里  但这并不是他的本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He zapped me here, yes, but he didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.08,0:32:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是一家人  他并不希望你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're family. ‭He doesn't want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.18,0:32:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他并不想看到这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.82,0:32:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.15,0:32:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.52,0:32:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.66,0:33:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让他付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.08,0:33:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.89,0:33:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是你每天起床的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get you out of bed in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.30,0:33:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当复仇成功  感觉非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when you get it, it feels great...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.29,0:33:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,能维持五分钟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for about five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.58,0:33:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.47,0:33:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也有过不少争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have had our fair share of fights --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.65,0:33:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than our share --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但无论闹得多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no matter how bad it got,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.81,0:33:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总能握手言和\N{\fnArial\fs30}we always made it right
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.27,0:33:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.35,0:33:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他也需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.60,0:33:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当一切都完蛋了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when everything goes to crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.45,0:33:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你就只剩下家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all you've got -- family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也许是个全能的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you might be a -- an all-powerful being...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.63,0:33:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得你其实也像个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think you're human where it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是需要你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You simply need your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.63,0:33:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.27,0:33:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.74,0:33:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这就是为什么你想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell. ‭Maybe that's why you wanted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.97,0:34:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但在你内心深处  你想要的并不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deep down, you didn't really want me...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.50,0:34:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我可以杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe I can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.53,0:34:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也许一旦我动了手  我们能永远幸福地活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if I pull this trigger, we all live happily ever after,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.53,0:34:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们会惨死身亡  也许这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe we die bloody, or maybe it doesn't matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.16,0:34:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们还有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}because maybe ‭there's a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.88,0:34:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要再问你一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.57,0:34:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,撇开你的愤怒  忘记你的恨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put aside the rage. Put aside the hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.90,0:34:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.07,0:34:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.45,0:34:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你再坚持一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you to try and hang in there
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.05,0:34:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再多坚持一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  我在努力支撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.34,0:34:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我去给你拿点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.96,0:35:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.13,0:35:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.47,0:35:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.04,0:35:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.95,0:35:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.46,0:35:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在最开始...\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.17,0:35:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,世间只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was just you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.35,0:35:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.04,0:35:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  我以为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you, and I thought --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.85,0:35:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.96,0:35:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你也爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.23,0:35:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.29,0:35:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.93,0:35:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但之后你创造了其他那堆东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you went and you made all these other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.91,0:35:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.42,0:35:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌你别有所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated you for needing something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.95,0:35:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是只需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.13,0:36:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就把我关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you locked me away,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.28,0:36:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我满脑子只想着报复你  让你痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all I could think about was making you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.37,0:36:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你有充分的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.33,0:36:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为报仇可以让我快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought revenge would make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.44,0:36:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.27,0:36:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你所造之物...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've made...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.74,0:36:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了很长时间才认清这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me a long time to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们回不到过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that we can't go back to the way things were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.22,0:36:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但我希望...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.01,0:36:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望我们可以重新成为一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that we could just be family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.27,0:36:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.93,0:37:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.35,0:37:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他居然成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bloody did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.21,0:38:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们要离开一阵子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I think we're just gonna go away for a while and...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.99,0:38:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  家庭聚会  我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yeah. Family meeting. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.87,0:38:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.70,0:38:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.01,0:38:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.91,0:38:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,地球会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.02,0:38:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,地球会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.34,0:38:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它还有你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got you...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.20,0:39:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  你给了我我最需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you gave me what I needed most.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想给予你同样的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  请节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.95,0:39:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你想聊聊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:39:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你有任何需要  我在所不辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:39:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.18,0:40:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.21,0:40:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.46,0:40:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.67,0:40:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是图妮·贝维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toni Bevell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,记录者  伦敦分会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters, London Chapterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定没听说过我...我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you won't have heard of me -- us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.96,0:40:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很传统的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.85,0:40:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不插手干预  专心学术科研\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep out of the way, keep to our studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.14,0:40:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你...什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.97,0:40:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们派我来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent me to take you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.40,0:40:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.34,0:40:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,假如世界没有终结的话...还真没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming the world didn't end, and -- Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.18,0:40:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  女士...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, lady --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.81,0:40:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直在观察你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been watching you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.31,0:40:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你所做的一切  你所造成的破坏...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've done, ‭the damage you've caused --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.12,0:40:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大天使  利维坦  黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}archangels, Leviathans, the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.86,0:40:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now, well --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.43,0:40:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,长老们决定不能再听之任之了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the old men have decided enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.40,0:40:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,面对现实吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, let's face it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.09,0:40:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个半路出家的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a jumped-up hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.52,0:40:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,捣鼓着你不了解的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing with things you don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所作所为弊大于利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and doing more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.23,0:41:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.48,0:41:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.45,0:41:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who the hell you are
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.89,0:41:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-或者你到底有什么企图  -站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- or what the hell you want -- ‭- Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.40,0:41:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了  站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.69,0:41:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我都知道你是不会扣下扳机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know you're not gonna pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.16,0:41:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.77,0:41:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底是在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.54,0:41:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.14,0:41:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.76,0:41:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?

